msgctxt "408"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "429"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "439"
msgid "Order"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "445"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "466"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "498"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "533"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "561"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "581"
msgid "Okay. That comes to %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "605"
msgid ""
"This'll make you popular with the ladies, I guarantee\n"
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "663"
msgid ""
"Rumored to bring good luck to its wearer. I vouch for\n"
"it myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"I got this from a guy with money problems for next to\n"
"nothing, so I'll sell it for cheap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "818"
msgid ""
"This is a tiger skin belt. It's real tiger leather, and \n"
"some say it provides mystical protection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "917"
msgid ""
"The irregular shape of this pearl makes it less\n"
"valuable than round ones, but some people prefer\n"
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"A demon's hideous face is drawn on this stone. It has\n"
"something to do with a guardian faith."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1113"
msgid ""
"This small kettle's got a charming retro look, and it's\n"
"quite practical to boot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1194"
msgid ""
"You like this 9-iron? It's not part of a set, but it's still\n"
"good for swinging around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1281"
msgid ""
"Ah, the bat. You'd be surprised how many foreigners\n"
"bring those in. Great for sandlot games."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1374"
msgid ""
"This Chinese broadsword is a legendary weapon from\n"
"China. It's light, but don't go swinging it around here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1482"
msgid ""
"This is an heirloom from the Lotus Clan, a famed \n"
"Chinese warrior family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid ""
"Made from wood even harder than red oak. I'm sure \n"
"getting hit with it would hurt, so be careful with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1662"
msgid ""
"This was apparently forged in the Edo Period. It's\n"
"quite distinctive, especially for an old blade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1761"
msgid "They say a water spirit inhabits this sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1806"
msgid ""
"If authentic, this thing would be a national treasure,\n"
"but I haven't gotten it appraised. Either way, it's\n"
"razor-sharp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1926"
msgid ""
"This quality steel blade is an unmarked old sword \n"
"but was forged with top-quality steel. That's worth\n"
"more than any maker's mark."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2057"
msgid ""
"The best sword I've got. It's said to pass through its\n"
"victims like a shadow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2135"
msgid ""
"One of my absolute favorites. It's about a spy\n"
"codenamed Dragon who uses funky tools to get out\n"
"of tight spots."
msgstr ""